<![CDATA[<span style="font-size: 12pt;"><p class="MsoPlainText" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Hello (!Core_Design_Registration__c.OwnerFirstName),</font></p><p class="MsoPlainText" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p class="MsoPlainText" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">The following Design Registration has been <b>Approved</b></font></p><p class="MsoPlainText" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p class="MsoPlainText" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b>Registration Number:</b>&nbsp;(!Core_Design_Registration__c.Name)</font></p><p class="MsoPlainText" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b>Design Registration Name:</b>&nbsp;(!Core_Design_Registration__c.Core_Design_Registration_Nm__c)</font></p><p class="MsoPlainText" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b>End Customer Name:</b>&nbsp;(!Core_Design_Registration__c.Core_End_Customer_Nm__c)</font></p><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Opportunity:</b>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 16px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Click&nbsp;</span><a href="https://intel--crmdevsls3.sandbox.my.site.com/partneradmin/s/opportunity/{!Core_Design_Registration__c.Core_Opportunity_IdId__c}" style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><b style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font color="#3333ff" style="">here</font></b></a><font size="4" style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</font><span style="font-size: 16px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">to view</span><font size="4" style="font-size: 12pt;">.<font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">&nbsp;</font></font><div style=""><font size="4"><br></font></div><div style=""><span style="font-size: 16px;">Temp table</span><font size="4"><br></font><p class="MsoPlainText" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><b style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><br></b></p><p class="MsoPlainText" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p class="MsoPlainText" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="">It is the Intel Partner's responsibility to understand the export, customs, and sanction controls applicable to Intel Partner's company, project, and product and take all actions necessary to ensure compliance.</font></p><p class="MsoPlainText" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p class="MsoPlainText" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">For more details, you can access it by clicking on this <a href="https://intel--crmdevsls3.sandbox.my.site.com/partneradmin/s/core-design-registration/{!Core_Design_Registration__c.Id}">link</a></font></p><p class="MsoPlainText" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p class="MsoPlainText" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font style="" face="Arial, sans-serif">Thank you.</font></p><p class="MsoPlainText" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="arial"><br></font></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; margin: 0in 0in 0pt;"><span style="font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;">_______________________________________________________________________<o:p></o:p></span></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; margin: 0in 0in 0pt;"